# CLIENT developer-tools config. Copy this file to client/.env.devtools
# (gitignored) and fill in the value.
#
# Vite loads it only for `--mode devtools` (npm run dev:devtools /
# build:devtools / preview:devtools) and only exposes variables whose names
# start with VITE_, so the name below must stay exactly VITE_DEV_SECRET.
#
# The dev-tools client is served locally by Vite but connects to the
# deployed Render server, like every other build. This value must equal the
# DEV_SECRET set in the Render service's environment settings — the Render
# BattleRoom is what checks it. It is baked into the dev-tools browser
# bundle, so it is not confidential on its own; the server-side check is the
# real gate. Never set it for the normal build, and never commit it.
VITE_DEV_SECRET=
